msgstr "ST VL53L0X / VL53L1X 激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:7
#: 3544b3c635f248abbe88bde3f01b8e5a 468881b4c3a04fabae7fb4d7373109a0
#: 4eb9595a7cf144d999c4756eb40e7998 cbe58b6457654cc7bb120af28aa7ab71
#: e98a4594de2e4df79fe436690a4f8ab0
msgid ""
"The `VL53L0X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-photonics-"
"solutions/vl53l0x.html>`__ & `VL53L1X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-"
"photonics-solutions/vl53l1x.html>`__ lidar are very small, affordable but "
"relatively short range (2m for VL53L0X & 4m for VL53L1X) time-of-flight "
"lidars"
msgstr ""
"`VL53L0X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-photonics-"
"solutions/vl53l0x.html>`__ 和 `VL53L1X <https://www.st.com/en/imaging-and-"
"photonics-solutions/vl53l1x.html>`__ 激光雷达体积极小、价格实惠，但量程相对较短（VL53L0X 为 "
"2m，VL53L1X 为 4m），采用飞行时间测距原理"

