"This sensor type is suitable for indoor use, however its range and precision"
" is significantly reduced in bright sunlight conditions and is not "
"recommended for outdoor use."
msgstr "该传感器适合室内使用，但在强阳光下量程和精度会大幅降低，不推荐用于室外场景。"

