msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:28
#: 4e727f8d91fd42e781b98786a1bc6380 5cd0fda28aa94d5e9de9c0c6aa8347b2
#: 6413a5eddd014ac18f6916e7bd5ec21a c19e391ce1a6435d83b343b18d849e37
#: f6c43df4e5ab4c0e9b17a2f90b86a87f
msgid ""
"Connect the VCC, GND, SDA and SCL lines of the lidar to the I2C port on the "
"autopilot as shown below for the first rangefinder."
msgstr "将激光雷达的 VCC、GND、SDA 和 SCL 线连接到飞控的 I2C 端口，作为第一个测距仪，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:32
#: 2a562b96cb954ba597ab20193b762f75 74c10c254a9b4f2fbd1a307808d263f7
#: a99d120e701645cd80bc1cb6afec1454 ebaf8ff7dfe743aa8b28e0a05a44ca7e
#: f37d934a48724eaaaa695d313a7e3429
msgid ""
"Please set the rangefinder parameters as shown below (this can be done using"
" the *Mission Planner* **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter List** page):"
msgstr ""
"请按如下设置测距仪参数（可通过 *Mission Planner* 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter "
"List** 页面进行设置）："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:34
#: 109905ef540c452793d2272a0c79b640 1622c18bd32b42f28920c29f60f72482
#: 2561e97dafdc4f41b1bd15719a2740bf 8a510b8c85c74602aca05496cffbff9f
#: f703899b0eac4adf8572058ea294b293
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 16 (VL53L0X)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 16（VL53L0X）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:35
#: 570514252adc426c97d1fca3a149eb13 5fa70789337b499aa01d00b18a2e254e
#: 8ad284595ac744b0938b85e25289d085 9869e33b020942f19543f37e0a43e730
#: 992c727a04e6455884acebbaec4ed908
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 41 (I2C Address of lidar in decimal).  "
"*The sensor's default I2C address is 0x29 hexadecimal which is 41 in "
"decimal.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ADDR <RNGFND1_ADDR>` = 41（十进制激光雷达 I2C 地址）。*传感器默认 I2C 地址为十六进制 "
"0x29，即十进制 41。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:36
#: 7a158a943a754a9d9c42c7149b6f597e 8b2940cefe2b4a4a95e681e806243a28
#: 8f36d222ab0543ff8530126c8a6b30ad a6e9195bbe914a52983a3f66844bf6d8
#: fe27adaf56cd420b89764471942fa82c
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_SCALING <RNGFND1_SCALING>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:37
#: 2b85438b7cfa4351a9f6b94c1844d9fe 3214cb3c89af46f99b287355a81b52a6
#: 3dd34db7eb674a0b9d92488d1a9d58d0 578d74fb5ce642fd8d56c718b38f9e7a
#: eb3a855466014180b3ed3c3270f09d49
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.05"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:38
#: 01d189c180344ddcb4ffa80c975c222a 07e0cdaec3b643baa58e42375f1e3999
#: 3f113bc377e24ae3959e6c1a452f6b45 64651d1bacfa43f084e63cb161fff0d4
#: cd07fa33ef2f46348b1883ff86c18225
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **1.2** for the VL53L0X, **3.6** for the "
"VL53L1X.  *This is the distance in meters that the rangefinder can reliably "
"read.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = **1.2** （VL53L0X），**3.6** "
"（VL53L1X）。*这是测距仪可可靠读取的距离，单位为米。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:39
#: 564a7e598c604237ab5c5e13a8f84f93 5a52382604ad44d889fc6f1a6ef4d08a
#: 7474da6d5a90421388c565234b6597a9 a58b1f43c8544b92a56c0bb8bd94b8cb
#: d041f5c1f61a4071a2ad55af82eb6588
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 *or more accurately the "
"distance in meters from the range finder to the ground when the vehicle is "
"landed.  This value depends on how you have mounted the rangefinder.*"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_GNDCLR <RNGFND1_GNDCLR>` = 0.1 "
"*或更准确地说，是飞行器着陆时测距仪到地面的距离（单位：米）。该值取决于测距仪的安装位置。*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:42
#: 8a019409a8974601a0af7a8ef3b27046 90d811915e8c4ef59a6ea8ed973edd89
#: b8b5d7c70aa24018b711cf6ec2efe1d6 c989684001d14744afd93aa5e15a276f
#: cfb21339f80f4bd79e0b7e6501de41ce
