msgstr "测试传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vl53l0x-lidar.rst:44
#: 15622f47d50f48bea0c7fa630b096492 1f9157a00eee49f7be1526ae1a810642
#: 2c4965a51e0040a3848ed8cb01a2d1e7 430febe1d71f47a296ab4e3f6ce5c2f4
#: c08163bd35594e9b87561f0fd074aa7a
msgid ""
"Distances read by the sensor can be seen in the Mission Planner's Flight "
"Data screen's Status tab. Look closely for \"rangefinder1\".(The value of "
"this image is not a real value.)"
msgstr ""
"传感器的读数可在 Mission Planner "
"飞行数据界面的「Status」选项卡中查看。仔细查找「rangefinder1」。（图中数值并非真实值。）"
